node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSONAL DATA. Read docs/06-privacy.md before touching this block.
#
# These five paths fill up with your phone number, your salary decisions, your
# visa status, your CV in full, and the names and email addresses of recruiters
# who never consented to being published.
#
# KEEPING THEM IGNORED (the default) means a public fork stays clean, and your
# tracker history is not in git. Keep a private backup of tracker.json; losing
# it loses the memory of your search.
#
# DELETING THESE LINES means your decision history is versioned, which is
# genuinely valuable. Then the repository must stay PRIVATE, permanently.
# A repo that was private and becomes public still carries every commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
profile/profile.json
profile/resume.json
profile/companies.json
tracker.json
applications/*
!applications/example-android-role/
applications/example-android-role/*
!applications/example-android-role/tailor.json
!applications/_watch/
applications/_watch/*
!applications/_watch/README.md

# Secrets. Never commit. The WhatsApp key lives here and nowhere else.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json

# Browser and MCP scratch output, never part of the project
.playwright-mcp/
.shots/
